---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import {games} from '../lib/catalog';
---
<Layout title="Licenses & credits"><article class="card prose"><h1 class="page-title">Licenses &amp; credits</h1><p>New website code is GPL-2.0-or-later. Individual engines and game data retain their own licenses. Clean-room builds are distributed from their own repositories, linked below, and contain no retail game data.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Game / project</th><th>Engine</th><th>Assets</th></tr></thead><tbody>{games.map(g=><tr><td><a href={g.source}>{g.title}</a></td><td>{g.engineLicense}</td><td>{g.assetLicense}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table><h2>Images</h2><p>Open Cadet and Open Digger use Andrew Nakas’s CC0 replacement art. OpenTTD screenshots use OpenGFX artwork. Freedoom images show its freely licensed replacement assets. Beneath a Steel Sky retains Revolution Software’s game-art rights. Image provenance is recorded in the source repository.</p><h2>Engine distributions</h2><p>Each distributed runtime links to its exact source and build instructions through its manifest. If an attribution or license record is wrong, please <a href="https://github.com/andrewnakas/decompgames/issues">report the specific file or entry</a>.</p></article></Layout>
